Mandōdarī gazes at Rāvaṇa and laments --- Mandōdarī marvels a mere man fells the world conqueror --- Mandōdarī blames lust for Sītā and scorned counsel --- Mandōdarī recalls past joys and present widowhood --- Mandōdarī mourns her own fate apart from Rāvaṇa --- Rāma bids Vibhīṣaṇa perform the obsequies --- Vibhīṣaṇa refuses to honor the adharmic brother --- Rāma declares enmity ends with death --- Vibhīṣaṇa cremates Rāvaṇa and consoles the women
